theorem ex6b: (a∧b) ∨ (b∧c) ∨ (c∧a) = (a∨b) ∧ (b∨c) ∧ (c∨a)
    (a∧b) ∨ (b∧c) ∨ (c∧a)          distribute
=   (a∨b∨c)∧(a∨b∨a)∧(a∨c∨c)∧(a∨c∨a)∧(b∨b∨c)∧(b∨b∨a)∧(b∨c∨c)∧(b∨c∨a)    symmetry and idempotence
